{"_id":"qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD","folder":null,"img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/spore-war-bestiary/shalelu-andosana.webp","items":[{"_id":"5r2yxehgid8uYT9p","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","name":"Ranger Warden Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"value":"focus"},"proficiency":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slots":{},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":33,"value":25},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.5r2yxehgid8uYT9p"},{"_id":"UMVLRADzhseXYkdN","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.rtA3HRGoy7PQTOhq"},"img":"icons/environment/wilderness/tree-oak.webp","name":"Terrain Transposition","sort":200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You mystically transpose your current location with another. While in a wilderness environment, you transport yourself and items you're holding to a clear space you can see within range. If you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.sgo7J9BVofBqwlsF]{Favored Terrain} and both your starting and ending position are in your favored terrain, the range increases to 180 feet. If you have an animal companion and it is adjacent to you, you can transport it along with you to an adjacent open space, but if this spell would bring any other creature with you, even in an extradimensional container, the spell is lost.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":5},"location":{"value":"5r2yxehgid8uYT9p"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"90 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"terrain-transposition","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[],"value":["concentrate","focus","manipulate","ranger","teleportation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.UMVLRADzhseXYkdN"},{"_id":"CVPdxPXQJNb4hBmv","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KktHf7zIAWOr499h"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/rangers-bramble.webp","name":"Ranger's Bramble","sort":300000,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":5},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You cause plants in the area to entangle your foes, with the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA]{Entangling Flora}. A creature that critically fails the save takes @Damage[(max(0,@item.level -1))d4[bleed]] damage in addition to being @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escaping} your bramble doesn't end the bleed damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The bleed damage on a critical failure increases by 1d4.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"5r2yxehgid8uYT9p"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"100 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"rangers-bramble","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[],"value":["concentrate","focus","manipulate","plant","ranger"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.CVPdxPXQJNb4hBmv"},{"_id":"purLzhruQvx2GPG1","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.RGBZrVRIEDb2G48h"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/soothing-mist.webp","name":"Soothing Mist","sort":400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d8","kinds":["damage","healing"],"materials":[],"type":"vitality"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You call forth a magical mist that envelops a creature. The mist restores 2d8 Hit Points to a target living creature and ends one source of persistent acid, bleed, fire, poison, or void damage affecting it. If the creature is taking persistent damage from multiple sources, you select which one is removed. Against an undead target, you deal 2d8 vitality damage (basic Fortitude save); if it fails the save, it also takes @Damage[(@item.rank)[persistent,vitality]] damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing (or damage to an undead target) increases by 1d8, and the persistent vitality damage to an undead creature increases by 1.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"5r2yxehgid8uYT9p"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"soothing-mist","target":{"value":"1 willing living creature or 1 undead creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[],"value":["concentrate","focus","healing","manipulate","ranger","vitality"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.purLzhruQvx2GPG1"},{"_id":"MeptcqiLTe5nHB7m","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IWUe32Y5k2QFd7YQ"},"img":"icons/weapons/ammunition/arrowhead-glowing-blue.webp","name":"Gravity Weapon","sort":500000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You build up gravitational force and funnel it into your blows, leading to more powerful attacks with blade and bow alike. On your first weapon Strike each round, you gain a status bonus to damage equal to twice the number of weapon damage dice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.tNjimcyUwn8afeH6]{Spell Effect: Gravity Weapon}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"5r2yxehgid8uYT9p"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"gravity-weapon","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"1"},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[],"value":["focus","ranger"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.MeptcqiLTe5nHB7m"},{"_id":"C3BAsM3sd9D8RIcx","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.4DnjM0PNivT2dlf9"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/specific-magic-weapons/hunters-bow.webp","name":"Hunter's Anthem","sort":600000,"system":{"ammo":{"baseType":"arrows","builtIn":false,"capacity":null},"baseItem":"longbow","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":2},"category":"martial","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":1,"die":"d8"},"description":{"value":"<p>This <em>+2 striking longbow</em> is carefully handcrafted from a length of flexible green-tinted wood, etched in a variety of runic symbols, and strung with a dawnsilver bowstring. When you shoot the bow in rapid succession, the echoing chords generated by the bowstring form a haunting dirge that evokes the inevitable end of all things. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.0nIOGpHQNHsKSFKT]{Hunt Prey} class feature, the weapon gains the <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.dTxbaa7HSiJbIuNN]{Thundering}</em> rune on Strikes against your prey.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Song of the Bow</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentration)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You shoot an arrow thrumming with the song of the bow. Make a Strike with the bow that deals damage as normal. As long as the Strike isn't a critical failure, the arrow explodes in a @Template[emanation|distance:20] around your target, dealing @Damage[5d10[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage to creatures in the area, including the target, with a @Check[fortitude|dc:28|basic|options:area-effect]. Any creature that critically fails is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 minute. If any creature in the area is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9evPzg9E6muFcoSk]{Unnoticed} by you, you learn its location, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to you instead.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":1,"group":"bow","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":12},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder GM Core"},"quantity":1,"range":100,"reload":{"value":"0"},"rules":[{"definition":["item:id:{item|_id}"],"key":"AdjustStrike","mode":"add","predicate":["feature:hunt-prey","hunted-prey"],"property":"property-runes","value":"thundering"}],"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":2},"size":"med","slug":"hunters-anthem","specific":{"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":2}},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["deadly-d10","volley-30"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-plus-hands"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.C3BAsM3sd9D8RIcx"},{"_id":"qbNWvdO7nOrKZQzX","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Y1dkRsRd1Z7Jf2y6"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/katana.webp","name":"Katana","sort":700000,"system":{"baseItem":"katana","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":1},"category":"martial","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"slashing","dice":1,"die":"d6"},"description":{"value":"<p>A katana is a curved, single-edged sword known for its wickedly sharped blade.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":null,"group":"sword","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":2}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"quantity":1,"range":null,"reload":{"value":null},"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":2,"property":["greaterFearsome"],"striking":1},"size":"med","slug":"katana","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","value":["deadly-d8","two-hand-d10","versatile-p"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.qbNWvdO7nOrKZQzX"},{"_id":"2apFl73dYfM24Fob","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ewQZ0VeL38v3qFnN"},"img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-layered-leather-studded-brown.webp","name":"Studded Leather Armor","sort":800000,"system":{"acBonus":2,"baseItem":"studded-leather-armor","bulk":{"value":1},"category":"light","checkPenalty":-1,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":