of 35 feet when she's in forested terrain.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.GvozhMHmzYj7lTf9"},{"_id":"uJtpGvQNwF0hYsDP","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Hunt Prey","sort":1500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Shalelu designates a single creature she can see and hear, or one she's Tracking, as her prey. She gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} the prey and to Survival checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track} the prey. The first time she hits her designated prey in a round, she deals an additional 2d8 precision damage. These effects last until she uses Hunt Prey again.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.HuntPrey.TargetHuntedPrey","option":"hunted-prey","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[{"or":["action:seek","action:track"]},"hunted-prey"],"selector":["perception","survival"],"type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.HuntPrey.FirstHitDamage","option":"first-attack","toggleable":true},{"category":"precision","diceNumber":2,"dieSize":"d8","key":"DamageDice","predicate":["first-attack"],"selector":"strike-damage"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["concentrate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.uJtpGvQNwF0hYsDP"},{"_id":"LBWd13hsFP4dpaq2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Nature's Edge","sort":1600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Enemies are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to Shalelu when they're in difficult terrain.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.LBWd13hsFP4dpaq2"},{"_id":"WDRlPoAwZW8uXjXt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Unimpeded Journey","sort":1700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Shalelu ignores the effects of difficult terrain and treats greater difficult terrain as difficult terrain.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.WDRlPoAwZW8uXjXt"},{"_id":"ezHLT9755m3LxJFr","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","name":"Forest Lore","sort":1800000,"system":{"description":{"value":""},"mod":{"value":21},"proficient":{"value":0},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"lore","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!qsO3TVzLIiFQsqsD.ezHLT9755m3LxJFr"}],"name":"Shalelu Andosana","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":1},"con":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":5},"int":{"mo